00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:50,000
Riverdance: The Animated Adventure is a animation,
fantasy, music film directed by Eamonn Butler.

2
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:34,000
A young Irish boy named Keegan and Spanish girl named Moya journey into a magical world of the
Megaloceros Giganteus who teach them to appreciate Riverdance as a celebration of life.

3
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:18,000
Based on the stage show phenomenon of the same name and featuring Bill
Whelan’s multi-platinum Grammy Award-winning music.

4
00:22:56,000 --> 00:23:02,000
Grandad / Patrick (voice), played by Pierce Brosnan.

