00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:26,000
Riverdance: The Animated Adventure is a 2021 animated dance
adventure film inspired by the dance show Riverdance.

11
01:03:04,000 --> 01:03:10,000
The film was made by Cinesite for River Productions and Aniventure.

12
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:54,000
Riverdance: The Animated Adventure was released in the United Kingdom on 28 May 2021, by Sky Cinema,
and was made available to stream on Netflix on 14 January 2022 in the United States.

13
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:38,000
The film explores themes of dance, grandparent grandchild
relationship, river, village, stage show.

14
01:20:16,000 --> 01:20:22,000
The tone is lighthearted.
